{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"58146b97dc57041a92f2c08f76fbcfb458146b97dc57041a92f2c08f76fbcfb4","inputId":"f2da0df789523c329ec6cafb01d394b8f2da0df789523c329ec6cafb01d394b8","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"I need the intended memory-recall behavior before repository work can be scoped safely.","conversationSummary":"The user requested a bounded repository change: add typed memory-recall behavior and tests. Writes are limited to src/calculator.ts and test/calculator.test.ts; .env, .git/**, bun.lock, and all other files are protected. The requested validation command is bun test when execution is appropriate. The memory-recall semantics remain unspecified.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Add the requested typed memory-recall behavior to the calculator module.","deliverables":["Implementation limited to src/calculator.ts.","Tests limited to test/calculator.test.ts."],"constraints":["Do not modify paths outside src/calculator.ts and test/calculator.test.ts.","Do not modify .env, .git/**, or bun.lock.","Run bun test when execution is appropriate.","Make no unrelated changes."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The requested memory-recall behavior is implemented with explicit type safety.","Relevant tests cover the agreed behavior.","No files outside the two allowed writer paths are changed."],"nonGoals":["Changing configuration, lockfiles, environment files, Git metadata, or unrelated behavior."]},"questions":[{"id":"memory_recall_semantics","prompt":"What exact memory-recall behavior should be implemented?","rationale":"The request does not define the memory API, stored value lifecycle, or behavior when no value has been stored; these choices determine both implementation and tests.","kind":"outcome","options":[{"id":"standard_memory_register","label":"Standard memory register","description":"Implement typed store, recall, clear, and additive/subtractive memory operations with a defined initial value.","recommended":true},{"id":"recall_only","label":"Recall only","description":"Implement a typed recall operation against the calculator's existing memory state, without adding new mutation operations.","recommended":false},{"id":"custom_contract","label":"Custom contract","description":"Provide the required method names, inputs, outputs, and edge-case behavior.","recommended":false}]}],"assumptions":[]}}
